+  # ---- THE VISIBILITY PROBE'S DECISION TABLE, DRIVEN OVER REAL HTTP AGAINST A LOOPBACK FIXTURE ------
+  #
+  # This is the assertion the whole reviewed-remote ruling rests on: the check can TELL public from
+  # private, so a 401 from the live remote is a MEASUREMENT rather than a probe that always says no.
+  #
+  # IT USED TO BE PROVEN AGAINST THIS REPOSITORY, and that was a fixture whose answer somebody else
